%description:
Tests abortRstWithAck, the RST of an abort of Linux (tcp_send_active_reset()).
The client aborts at t=2 s: its RST carries the ACK bit and RCV.NXT (501), and
the TS option echoes TS.Recent, because the ACK bit is set. Without the
parameter, the RST is <SEQ=SND.NXT><CTL=RST> of RFC 9293, with TSecr 0.

%inifile: omnetpp.ini
[General]
record-vector-results = false
ned-path = .;../../../../src;../../lib

cmdenv-event-banners=false
cmdenv-express-mode=false

*.testing=true
cmdenv-log-prefix="[%c]: "

*.cli_app.sendScript="1.0 100"
*.cli_app.tAbort=2s
*.cli_tcp.abortRstWithAck = true
*.*_tcp.timestampSupport = true

include ../../lib/defaults.ini

%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%file: postrun.pl
open FILE, '<test.out';
while($sor = <FILE>)
{
    if ($sor =~ /^\[testing\]: (.*)$/)
    {
        print "$1\n";
    }
}
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%postrun-command:  perl ./postrun.pl
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%contains: postrun-command(1).out
[1.001 A003] A.1000 > B.2000: A 1:101(100) ack 501 win 16384   Option(s): NOP NOP TS(1000,2)
[1.203 B002] A.1000 < B.2000: A ack 101 win 16384   Option(s): NOP NOP TS(1202,1000)
cli_tcp: ESTABLISHED --> CLOSED  (on ABORT)
[2.001 A004] A.1000 > B.2000: A R ack 501 win 0   Option(s): NOP NOP TS(2000,1202)
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%postrun-command: grep "undisposed object:" test.out > test_undisposed.out || true
%not-contains: test_undisposed.out
undisposed object: (
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
